  "task": "A burst water pipe at Central Station has flooded the ticket machines and platforms, disrupting service on the Blue Line since this morning. I need to assess current vehicle impacts, publish alerts about the disruption, arrange urgent repairs, and process fare refunds for affected passengers traveling during the outage period."
